cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Bilingual catalogue of a sound and music archive (db, 2018)"
version: "34"
abstract: "This database catalogues the recordings and scores of a sound and music archive, with a bilingual Italian–Slovene interface. Each record describes a piece by musical landscape, category and field, original and new file name, title, author, album, archive, arrangement, ensemble, performer, informant, place and date of recording, province, publisher and year, conductor, notes and score. Earlier separate lists were merged into a single catalogue through append queries."
